    "id": "risks-becoming-more-global-and-volatile-value-of-reinsurance-never-more-evident-",
    "title": "Risks becoming more global and volatile, value of reinsurance never more evident: Munich Re",
    "title_original": "Risks becoming more global and volatile, value of reinsurance never more evident: Munich Re",
    "url": "https://www.artemis.bm/news/risks-becoming-more-global-and-volatile-value-of-reinsurance-never-more-evident-munich-re/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=risks-becoming-more-global-and-volatile-value-of-reinsurance-never-more-evident-munich-re",
    "summary": "Munich Re, one of the world’s largest reinsurance companies, has underscored that the value of reinsurance has never been more evident than it is today, as risks continue to become more global and volatile. Thomas Blunck, Member of the Board of Management, Munich Re, commented: “The value of reinsurance has never been more evident than it is today. At the 2026 Monte Carlo at the Rendez-vous event, Munich Re described reinsurance as society’s immune system, but cautioned that the industry is facing an abundance of uncertainties from the changing climate, geopolitical tensions, and rapid technological development.",
