    "url": "https://www.reinsurancene.ws/abundant-capacity-and-volatility-are-helping-the-re-insurance-market-innovate-aons-lyons/",
    "summary": "“But what I think makes us most excited about this renewal season is that that increase in capacity, in capital and increase in volatility is also really driving increases in innovation.” During the briefing, Lyons reviewed market conditions for each line of business and highlighted the corresponding innovations emerging within them. The executive, who serves as CEO of Bermuda and Global Head of Products, argued that unprecedented capacity across nearly every line of business is a key opening for cedents to reset and future-proof their programmes against market volatility. In property, reinsurers continue to generate strong double-digit return on equity (ROE), with pricing still holding above 30% over the index at the height of the stock market, Lyons notes.",
