    "summary": "Aviva has launched a hybrid fronting offering for larger, established MGAs through its Global Corporate &amp; Specialty business. As demand grows for partners that can support international, multi-class programmes, our hybrid model gives MGAs, brokers and reinsurers a single route into Aviva&#8217;s global reach, specialist underwriting expertise and financial strength. The offering combines fronting capacity with risk retention and is designed for multi-country, multi-line insurance programs generating at least £20 million in gross written premium.",
