    "summary": "Liberty Specialty Markets is providing eligible political risk policyholders with access to a security consultation from Blackthorn Risk Group. This investment is a clear demonstration of our willingness to provide a differentiated, market-leading offering to our clients.&#8221; &#8211; William Limb, Head of Political Risk Solutions, Liberty Specialty Markets. Clients purchasing qualifying political risk coverage through Liberty’s London team can opt in to a free 60-minute virtual session with a senior Blackthorn adviser.",
