    "summary": "Insurance claims have always been document-heavy, time-sensitive, and prone to fraud. A Swiss Re article written by Florian Maurer, chief D&T officer Corporate Solutions, and Vincent Plantard, GL head of Performance, Analytics and Delivery at Claims Corporate Solutions, describes how SwissRe built and deployed ClaimsGenAI to automate its corporate insurance claims handling process. SwissRe’s annual corporate insurance claims now exceed 40,000, creating a clear need for a step change in how the company manages growing caseloads.",
