    "title": "Catastrophe bond fund UCITS Index delivers 1.24% average return in August: Plenum",
    "title_original": "Catastrophe bond fund UCITS Index delivers 1.24% average return in August: Plenum",
    "url": "https://www.artemis.bm/news/catastrophe-bond-fund-ucits-index-delivers-1-24-average-return-in-august-plenum/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=catastrophe-bond-fund-ucits-index-delivers-1-24-average-return-in-august-plenum",
    "summary": "Catastrophe bond fund structured in the UCITS investment format delivered their strongest month of performance year-to-date through the August days of record, averaging 1.24% for the period, while the 12-month rolling return average across the Plenum CAT Bond UCITS Fund Indices slipped a little further to 9.82%. The average return of UCITS catastrophe bond funds is the strongest so far in 2026 for a reporting period, since the nearest last end of month reporting of this Index, on July 31st through to August 28th 2026, at 1.24%. On the back of this, the average year-to-date performance of the UCITS catastrophe bond fund strategies rose from 4.09 % as of July 31st, to now 5.38% as of August 28th 2026.",
