    "url": "https://www.reinsurancene.ws/axa-xl-re-cautious-ahead-of-jan-renewals-but-aims-to-provide-consistent-pricing-and-appetite-through-the-cycle-ceo-guidee/",
    "summary": "Global reinsurer AXA XL Re is cautious heading into the key January 1 2027 renewals as there’s still time for meaningful loss events to impact the industry, but in a market with improved discipline, the focus is on providing consistency of pricing and appetite through the cycle, according to CEO Renaud Guidée. “For both property and casualty, we aim to provide consistency of pricing and appetite through the cycle,” he added. But the season is not over and we therefore remain cautious heading into the 1/1 renewals,” he said.",
