  {
    "id": "value-of-reinsurance-has-never-been-more-evident-as-risks-become-more-global-vol",
    "title": "‘Value of reinsurance has never been more evident’ as risks become more global & volatile: Munich Re",
    "title_original": "‘Value of reinsurance has never been more evident’ as risks become more global & volatile: Munich Re",
    "url": "https://www.reinsurancene.ws/value-of-reinsurance-has-never-been-more-evident-as-risks-become-more-global-volatile-munich-re/",
    "summary": "Thomas Blunck, Member of the Board of Management, Munich Re, said: “The value of reinsurance has never been more evident than it is today. At the 68th annual meeting of the reinsurance industry in Monte Carlo, Munich Re, one of the world’s largest reinsurance companies, underlined the importance of a resilient reinsurance sector as risks are “becoming more global and more volatile.” Munich Re describes reinsurance as society’s immune system, but warns that the industry is facing an abundance of uncertainties from the changing climate, geopolitical tensions, and rapid technological development. “Consequently, such natural hazards are shifting more and more from being primarily ecological risks to economic risks, even though it is not always easy to establish a causal link in the case of heat-related damage,” said Munich Re.",
    "category": "General",
    "source": "Reinsurance News",
    "published_at": "2026-09-06T14:46:11.711040+00:00",
